      "short": "Snout jab, hoof stomp, scoop, then the Gravel Toss",
      "desc": "Dozer's head-first string, every hit building Caked. Press again to keep it going: the jab, a stamping fore-hoof, a scoop that launches, and on the fourth press the Gravel Toss flicks the target aside behind a fan of gravel. Out of a dodge it is the Shoulder Barge.",
