      "hold": "charge",
      "short": "Armoured horn lunge; hold to load the Quarry Ram",
      "desc": "A head-down lunge that drives the horn through light hits. Hold the button to keep winding it up and release into the Quarry Ram: a three-metre armoured dash ending in a horn uppercut that crushes guards. Both leave him stretched out: dodge the lunge and punish the recovery.",
