      "desc": "Dozer paws the floor and charges up to six metres, armoured the whole way and steered a little with the stick. The first fighter he meets is carried along, and a wall at the end is a splat and a knockdown. Sidestep the run-up, or make him charge an empty wall: he staggers off it.",
